# KIPPER: dirt stops the sub until the Auger is fitted: then a dash (or the
# long thruster) digs through it. Dirt grows back whenever the sub docks.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat fit 6
cheat tile 79 96
wait 2
expect tile_79_98 == 100
hold DOWN 40
expect ty == 97
press DOWN+B 4
hold DOWN 30
expect ty == 97
cheat fit 1
hold DOWN+B 6
hold DOWN 4
hold DOWN+B 6
hold DOWN 4
hold DOWN+B 6
hold DOWN 20
expect ty >= 100
expect tile_79_98 == 46
cheat dock 0
expect tile_79_98 == 100
